# Normalise line endings so the repo stays usable from Windows, macOS and Linux.
#
# The Python and JavaScript sources are plain text and should be stored with LF;
# Git will check them out with the platform default. The HTML report and the
# CSV/SQLite outputs are generated and gitignored, so they need no rules.
#
# *.bat is the exception: cmd.exe is happiest with CRLF, and dist/edh.bat is the
# entry point handed to non-technical users, so it is pinned explicitly.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary assets that must never be line-ending-mangled.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
*.xlsx binary
